ng — its own customers, its own stock, its own daily routines. Off-the-shelf software asks you to change those routines. We build tools around them instead: <a href="/expertise-web-development/">websites and web applications</a>, dashboards and business tools shaped by how your team actually works.</p><p>We work with businesses across real estate, e-commerce, healthcare, education, B2B &amp; industrial, and FMCG &amp; retail. Whatever the industry, the starting point is the same — a conversation about the work that takes too long, the spreadsheet that has grown too big, or the process nobody enjoys.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>What we build</h2><p>Practical tools, purposeful design — software your team will actually use.</p></div><div class="values"><article class="reveal"><span>01</span><h3>Websites &amp; web applications</h3><p>Fast, clear websites and web apps your customers can use with ease — designed and built in-house, from the first sketch to launch.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>02</span><h3>Business tools &amp; dashboards</h3><p>One place to see the numbers that matter — orders, stock, enquiries or bookings — instead of hunting through spreadsheets.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>03</span><h3>Inventory &amp; operations tools</h3><p>Tools that keep stock, orders and everyday operations in order — like Stockdesk, our inventory workspace for plumbing businesses, below.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>04</span><h3>Custom workflows</h3><p>The small, repeated jobs that eat your day — quotes, follow-ups, records — turned into simple steps inside a tool built for them.</p></article></div></section><section class="section"><div class="software-feature"><div class="software-art"><span>STOCKDESK</span><h2>Everything<br>in its place.</h2><div class="inventory-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><small>PLUMBING INVENTORY / SOFTWARE</small></div><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / INVENTORY MANAGEMENT</span><h2>Stockdesk</h2><p>A dedicated workspace for plumbing inventory and stock workflows.</p><p>See how it fits your operation in a guided walkthrough.</p><a class="button" href="/contact-us/?interest=Stockdesk%20demo">Request a walkthrough ↗</a><a class="hero-secondary" href="/login/">Owner access →</a></div></div><div id="software-public" class="library-grid"></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>How a project moves</h2><p>From first conversation to launch — and beyond. Every project follows the same five steps.</p></div><div class="values"><article class="reveal"><span>01</span><h3>Discover</h3><p>We learn how your business works today — the people, the process and the problem worth solving.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>02</span><h3>Plan</h3><p>We agree what the tool will do, what it will not do, and what success looks like — before anything is built.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>03</span><h3>Build</h3><p>Design and development happen together, so the tool is clear to use as well as sound underneath.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>04</span><h3>Launch</h3><p>We walk your team through the finished tool and stay close while it settles into daily work.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>05</span><h3>Grow</h3><p>Your business changes, and the tool can change with it — improved in small steps, as you need them.</p></article></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Custom software, answered</h2><p>The questions businesses ask us most before starting a software project.</p></div><div class="values"><article class="reveal"><span>01</span><h3>What kind of software do you build?</h3><p>Websites, web applications and business tools — dashboards, inventory and operations tools, and custom workflows built around how your team works. Every project starts with your process, not with a feature list.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>02</span><